  "Software Details": "Détails du logiciel",
  "The Campaign Module allows you to design and launch marketing campaigns without hassle. With its user-friendly interface, you can quickly set up campaign details, including target audience, campaign objectives, and promotional materials. This streamlined process ensures that you can focus on crafting compelling messages and visuals to captivate your audience, rather than getting bogged down in technical details.": "Le module Campagne vous permet de concevoir et de lancer des campagnes marketing sans tracas. ",
  "/Month": "/Mois",
